WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
I call it "The 
Toothbrush Helmet."&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.901 --> 00:00:16.592
So my toothbrush 
helmet is

00:00:16.592 --> 00:00:19.635
recommended by zero&nbsp;
out of 10 dentists,

00:00:19.635 --> 00:00:21.425
and it definitely did not

00:00:21.425 --> 00:00:23.717
revolutionize the 
world of dentistry,

00:00:23.717 --> 00:00:26.361
but it did completely 
change my life.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.411
Since then, I've carved 
out this little niche

00:00:29.411 --> 00:00:30.894
for myself on
 the internet

00:00:30.894 --> 00:00:33.220
as an inventor of 
useless machines,

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:34.973
because as we all know,

00:00:34.973 --> 00:00:38.603
the&nbsp;easiest way to be 
at the top of your field

00:00:38.603 --> 00:00:40.924
is to choose a 
very small field.

00:00:40.924 --> 00:00:42.562
To me that's&nbsp;the 
true beauty

00:00:42.562 --> 00:00:44.505
of making useless things,

00:00:44.505 --> 00:00:46.352
because it's this 
acknowledgment

00:00:46.352 --> 00:00:48.795
that you&nbsp;don't always know 
what the best answer is.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.865
And it turns off that 
voice in your head

00:00:51.865 --> 00:00:53.550
that&nbsp;tells you that you know

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:55.314
exactly how the 
world works.

00:00:55.314 --> 00:00:57.575
And maybe a toothbrush 
helmet isn't the&nbsp;answer,

00:00:57.575 --> 00:00:59.559
but at least you're 
asking the question.

